This directory is a MODIFIED copy of wvkbd 0.15
  upstream: https://git.sr.ht/~proycon/wvkbd  (tag v0.15, commit 2f72b176cbdbf55f101330758104d652dd371a0c)
  Copyright (c) 2020 John Sullivan <jsullivan@csumb.edu> and wvkbd contributors.

Licensing is unchanged from upstream (see COPYING, LICENSE, COPYING_WESTON):
  - os-compatibility.[ch]: MIT/X (Wayland project), see COPYING_WESTON
  - everything else: GNU GPL v3.0, see LICENSE

Modifications made for DuoLinux (Retroid Pocket Duo Lite), 2026:
  - main.c: new `--output NAME` option; binds wl_output v4, records each
    output's name and pins the layer surface to the named output.
  - uinput.c, uinput.h (new files) and keyboard.c/keyboard.h/main.c:
    key events are sent through a kernel uinput device when available,
    because KWin does not implement zwp_virtual_keyboard_v1.
    (The unmodified Makefile picks up uinput.c via its *.c wildcard.)

The exact changes are the diff between the "Import wvkbd 0.15" commit and the
following commit in this repository's history. These modifications are
released under the GNU GPL v3.0, the same licence as the original.
